Summary:
1. **Primary Request and Intent:**

   - **(Msg 1)** User asked: is "View in Lobu ↗" still present in Slack? Slack sends two messages per agent turn — is that expected? User recalled that "we recently moved out of the view in lobu and instead let the ai agent know which conversatinId and agentid and behaviorid triggered it and their gateway urls so when the user asks it knows but we don't need to put explicit view in lobu etc"
