2. **Key Technical Concepts:**
   - Lobu monorepo: Bun workspace, `packages/*`, `core`/`server`/`agent-worker`/`plugin-conversations`/`plugin-host`/`connectors`/`owletto` (submodule)
   - `ThreadResponsePayload` terminal completion row as replica-safe carrier (`finalText`, `toolsUsed`, now `repliedInBand`)
   - Multi-replica correctness: no shared in-memory state; payload-as-carrier avoids cross-pod coordination
   - Post-once vs live-streaming platform strategies (`deliversAtCompletion`)
   - Opaque conversation handles (`c_`/`t_` base64url), re-resolved server-side per call
   - Signed worker tokens carrying `conversationId`
   - `trigger.output`: `"silent" | "reply_to_source"`, default `"silent"`
